Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.14,0:00:03.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(忆往昔)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.00,0:00:04.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,, 《凶鬼恶灵》  作者是卡文·爱德路德\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Supernatural" by Carver Edlund.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.82,0:00:04.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.91,0:00:06.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,卡文·爱德路德的真名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's Carver Edlund's real name?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.53,0:00:07.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,恰克·舒尔利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chuck Shurley?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.16,0:00:09.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谁给你权利来写我们的生活的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who gave you the rights to our life story?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.25,0:00:10.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,总有一天  这些书\N{\fnArial\fs30}One day, these books --
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.31,0:00:12.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,会被称为温彻斯特福音\N{\fnArial\fs30}they'll be known as the Winchester Gospel.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.28,0:00:13.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你想知道她是什么吗  克劳力\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wanna know what she is, Crowley?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.44,0:00:15.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-上帝的妹妹怎么样  -他还有亲戚\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How about God's sister? - He has relatives?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.94,0:00:18.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她一来  大家就变疯狂僵尸了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what, she shows up, and everybody goes "28 Days Later"?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.19,0:00:19.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-这是梅塔特隆  -上帝的书记员\N{\fnArial\fs30}- This is Metatron. - Scribe of God.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.77,0:00:22.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你的能量在我们这里  现在你是凡人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have your grace. You're mortal now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.08,0:00:23.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,各种羞辱...\N{\fnArial\fs30}The indignities!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.95,0:00:24.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我在找上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm looking for God.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.97,0:00:26.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天启的时候他都没出现\N{\fnArial\fs30}He didn't feel the need to show up for the apocalypse.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.53,0:00:29.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他只是不觉得这是他的问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}He just doesn't think it's his problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.25,0:00:30.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在为什么就会在乎了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would he give a crap now?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.52,0:00:32.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道  或许因为那是他妹妹\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know, maybe because she's his sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.57,0:00:34.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你的天选之民在受苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}All your chosen are suffering!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.76,0:00:36.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别指望上帝  指望我们自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't count on God! Count on us.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.73,0:00:38.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也许现在他会听到我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe now He'll hear me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.58,0:00:40.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(如今)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.24,0:00:56.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(哈利和安妮熟食品店私人财产  不供公众使用)
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.30,0:01:03.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,熏牛肉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pastrami...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.50,0:01:05.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好像是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.28,0:01:38.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我放弃\N{\fnArial\fs30}I give up!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.01,0:01:51.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯  托托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, Toto.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.46,0:01:55.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我也觉得我们不在地球上了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got a feeling we aren't on Earth anymore, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.23,0:02:08.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谁啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.50,0:02:10.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.19,0:02:19.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,卡文·爱德路德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carver Edlund?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.59,0:02:21.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell is going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.27,0:02:22.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是什么地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is this place?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.37,0:02:23.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是家酒吧  事实上\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a bar. Actually --
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.77,0:02:25.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,才不是什么普通酒吧  大天才\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not just a bar, genius,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.93,0:02:28.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是老大建的\N{\fnArial\fs30}this is one of the Big Man's constructs.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.94,0:02:30.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我在哪都认得出他的手笔\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd know his work anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.42,0:02:32.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们曾是好闺蜜呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were besties, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.00,0:02:33.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我倒不会说...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I wouldn't exactly say --
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.50,0:02:35.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是惩罚  是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is some kind of punishment, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.92,0:02:37.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,惩罚我的罪孽\N{\fnArial\fs30}For my sins.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.52,0:02:39.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,让我永远待在地狱边缘\N{\fnArial\fs30}A limbo where I get to spend eternity
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.86,0:02:42.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一间烂酒吧里  跟个捉刀作家待在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}in a crappy bar with a hack writer.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.29,0:02:43.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哥们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.94,0:02:46.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉  恰小克  不是一般的捉刀作家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, Chuckles, not just any hack writer --
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.00,0:02:47.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是主的先知\N{\fnArial\fs30}a Prophet of the Lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.43,0:02:49.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,饶了我吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me a break.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.06,0:02:53.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,至少告诉我这里的啤酒是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me at least the beer is real in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.35,0:02:57.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你真觉得我那么差\N{\fnArial\fs30}You really think I'm a hack?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.05,0:03:02.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我艰难地读完了你所有的作品\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have trudged through your complete oeuvre --
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.61,0:03:04.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不管是出版的还是未出版的\N{\fnArial\fs30}published and unpublished.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.62,0:03:09.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我这辈子阅书无数\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of the metric ton of books I've read in my lifetime,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.90,0:03:13.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,, 《凶鬼恶灵》都挤不进前一\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Supernatural" didn't even crack the top 10...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.46,0:03:15.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,万\N{\fnArial\fs30}thousand.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.82,0:03:16.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,无意冒犯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Respectfully.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.78,0:03:19.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你一点也不喜欢吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't like any of it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.46,0:03:21.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-"家"(参见S01E09)呢  -不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Not even "Home"? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.46,0:03:22.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还有"地狱爆发"(参见S02E21)\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or "All Hell Breaks Loose"?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.61,0:03:25.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太矫情了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Way too much melodrama.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.25,0:03:28.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,然后你还把自己加进了故事里\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then you put yourself in the story?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.49,0:03:29.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,上帝啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}God!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.00,0:03:32.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  这有些道理  有点建设性\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, that's fair. Mildly constructive.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.96,0:03:34.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不过  那你也不该\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still, it doesn't justify you...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.76,0:03:36.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,烧掉我的一本书\N{\fnArial\fs30}burning one of my books, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.04,0:03:39.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你说什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.15,0:03:40.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"荒诞故事"(参见S02E15)\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Tall Tales."
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.34,0:03:42.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你在对着小卡独白(参见S09E18)\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were monologuing it to Castiel,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.34,0:03:44.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.12,0:03:44.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,然后把一本书丢进了火里\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you threw one in the fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.00,0:03:47.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you know about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.00,0:03:49.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉  我总是忘\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I'm sorry. I always forget.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.84,0:03:51.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我可以不让人们看到我  除非我想显现\N{\fnArial\fs30}People can't see me unless I want them to see me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.82,0:03:53.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是挺让人糊涂\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's very confusing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.27,0:03:55.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,给你  助视眼镜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here, visual aid.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.53,0:03:57.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,戴上  会好点的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put these on. It will help.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.68,0:03:58.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,戴吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go on, just do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.84,0:04:00.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是配套的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a whole thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.90,0:04:10.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.74,0:04:13.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}God.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.43,0:04:19.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,[邪恶力量 第11季第20集]
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.64,0:04:21.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}God.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.53,0:04:23.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.98,0:04:28.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真不敢相信你回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't believe you've come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.82,0:04:31.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我无意污蔑《凶鬼恶灵》的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I didn't mean what I said about "Supernatural."
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.18,0:04:33.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,绝对是被低估了  应该重启\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's underrated -- due for a reboot.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.80,0:04:36.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这间酒吧  也一点不烂\N{\fnArial\fs30}And this bar -- it's not crappy at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.12,0:04:37.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就像喜剧《干杯》里的那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just like the one in "Cheers."
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.73,0:04:39.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.73,0:04:39.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,大家都知道我的名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody knows my name!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.39,0:04:41.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-光线也非常柔和  -行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And the lights are very forgiving. - Okay, yeah, please,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.28,0:04:42.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别下跪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}all the kneeling and stuff,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.14,0:04:44.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这总让我觉得特别不舒服\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's always made me deeply, deeply uncomfortable.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.05,0:04:47.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别叫我上帝  好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just don't use the G-word, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.21,0:04:49.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就喊我恰克吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just -- Just call me Chuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.45,0:04:52.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,恰克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chuck?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.73,0:04:53.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,恰克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.20,0:04:57.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.62,0:05:00.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我需要来杯更烈的酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I need a stiffer drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.68,0:05:10.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太好了  我们正需要西装\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, perfect. We're gonna need our suits.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.65,0:05:12.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你查到阿玛拉的线索了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me you got something on Amara.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.88,0:05:14.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,希望不大  但时间紧迫嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, it's a long shot, but clock's ticking, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.96,0:05:16.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,阿玛拉在不知怎么折磨路西法呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever Amara's doing to Lucifer.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.54,0:05:19.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-还顺便暴揍小卡  -是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah, beating on Cass in the meantime. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.69,0:05:22.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,爱达荷州  希望泉镇  一个韦斯·库珀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, Hope Springs, Idaho. A guy named Wes Cooper
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.06,0:05:24.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,杀死一名同事后自杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}killed himself after killing a co-worker.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.07,0:05:23.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.16,0:05:26.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,据报告称  没人知道原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}According to the reports, though, nobody knows why.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.08,0:05:28.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,据说  他原本好端端的  然后突然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apparently, he was a perfectly happy guy, and then...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.80,0:05:30.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-发狂了  -怎么  附身吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- snap. - So, what, possession?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.47,0:05:31.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或者是被吃了灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or he was soulless.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.71,0:05:34.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,线索不多  但鉴于现状  我也接受了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It ain't much, but given what we've got, I'll take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.87,0:05:35.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.84,0:05:36.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}There you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.79,0:05:37.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.22,0:05:45.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哥们  别再用啤酒熨我的衬衫了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude, quit ironing my shirts with beer!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.22,0:05:54.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你最近如何啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what you been up to?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.48,0:05:55.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我超级忙的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I've been super busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.88,0:05:56.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  我旅行来着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I traveled.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.41,0:06:00.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我建立了一个博客  大都是放些猫的照片\N{\fnArial\fs30}I started a blog. Mostly just pictures of cats.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.09,0:06:02.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,猫咪太可爱了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're so cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.06,0:06:04.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对了  我还注册了阅后即焚账号\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, uh -- Oh, I signed up for Snapchat.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.44,0:06:06.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我还开始写新系列书了\N{\fnArial\fs30}A-And I started a new series of books.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.84,0:06:09.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是的  《革命》\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. "Revolution."
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.75,0:06:12.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但我觉得没什么前途\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I don't think it's going anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.31,0:06:13.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-《革命》  -是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- "Revolution"? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.81,0:06:15.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,, 《凶鬼恶灵》\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Supernatural".
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.82,0:06:17.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或许你不太会起标题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe titles aren't your thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.76,0:06:19.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你说得有理\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.35,0:06:26.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但你为什么要进入恰克的身体\N{\fnArial\fs30}But why did you put on the Chuck suit in the first place?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.21,0:06:29.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是怎么想的啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did that make any sense to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.96,0:06:31.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我喜欢前排看戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like front-row seats.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.74,0:06:34.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想藏在眼皮底下\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I figured I'd hide out in plain sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.45,0:06:37.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而且  演戏是很有意思的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, plus, you know, acting is fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.88,0:06:43.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,的确是奥斯卡级的表演\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well...it's an Oscar-worthy performance.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.03,0:06:47.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但怎么会没人知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}But...how did nobody know?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.63,0:06:49.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那个护身符怎么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, w-what about that amulet thingy?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.68,0:06:51.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你跟我说过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Y-You told me about it, some...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.84,0:06:56.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是在你面前会发光的咒符\N{\fnArial\fs30}silly charm that burned brightly in the presence of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.92,0:06:58.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-这个吗  -对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You mean this? - Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.61,0:06:59.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩就有个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean had it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.19,0:07:02.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还有你的宠儿  卡西迪奥\N{\fnArial\fs30}And your fav -- Castiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.64,0:07:05.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-他们接近你的时候  怎么  -我给关掉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- They were around you. How did it never - I turned it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.48,0:07:06.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瞧\N{\fnArial\fs30}See?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.01,0:07:11.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我真的该把这个放好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should really put this away.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.57,0:07:14.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你绝想不到这东西一直放在了哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll never guess where this thing has been this entire time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.70,0:07:17.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我才不在乎那个难看的破玩意呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I don't care about that ugly old thing
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.72,0:07:20.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或是你为什么要到平民之中体验生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}or why you were slumming it with the plebes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.51,0:07:23.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们说点要紧的吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's brass some tacks already, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.74,0:07:28.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你什么都看得见  听得见\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see and hear all.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.80,0:07:32.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道我这几年来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what an absolute piece of garbage I've been
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.14,0:07:33.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,多人渣\N{\fnArial\fs30}the last couple of years.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.93,0:07:38.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你带我过来是想毁灭我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you bring me here to destroy me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.99,0:07:45.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道人类最伟大的创造是什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what humanity's greatest creation has been?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.33,0:07:49.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,音乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Music.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.86,0:07:51.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还有玉米片奶酪\N{\fnArial\fs30}That and nacho cheese.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.61,0:07:54.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就连我都无法想出那么美味的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even I couldn't have dreamt up that deliciousness.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.17,0:07:56.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但音乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}But music...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.19,0:07:58.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是魔法\N{\fnArial\fs30}is magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.46,0:08:03.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这个地方曾创造出过很多了不起的音乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}A lot of remarkable music was created in this space.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.04,0:08:06.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,酒吧餐厅\N{\fnArial\fs30}B.G.'s Canteen.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.36,0:08:09.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,虽然不如结局或煤气灯有名\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, it's not as well-known as the Bitter End or the Gaslight,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.04,0:08:13.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但有些了不起的音乐人正是在这个舞台上起步\N{\fnArial\fs30}but some amazing musicians got their start on this stage.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.80,0:08:17.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我希望我们能沾染一点那份魔法\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm hoping that you and I can tap into some of that old magic
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.62,0:08:19.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,完成我几个月前开始进行的创作\N{\fnArial\fs30}and finish what I started a few months ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.13,0:08:24.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(上帝  一本自传)
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.36,0:08:31.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你在写自传\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wrote your autobiography.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.04,0:08:31.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,算是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ish.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.95,0:08:34.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就是写了几章  结构比较松散\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, there are chapters, it's kind of a loose structure,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.96,0:08:37.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,说不好  还缺了点什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}uh, but, I don't know, something's missing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.71,0:08:39.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我遇到瓶颈了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm -- I'm stuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.75,0:08:41.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你想重组乐队\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to get the old band back together.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.35,0:08:44.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,列侬和麦卡尼  重新上路\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lennon and McCartney ride again.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.00,0:08:48.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我算是综合了列侬和麦卡尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'm kind of Lennon and McCartney, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.63,0:08:50.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但每位作家都需要个好编辑\N{\fnArial\fs30}But every writer needs a good editor.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.88,0:08:53.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我最棒的一些作品都是与你一起写的  梅塔特隆\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did some of my best work with you, Metatron.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.53,0:08:55.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那么我又能做天使了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does this mean I get to be an angel again?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.50,0:08:56.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,呵呵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.85,0:08:58.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  那个你别指望了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, that's never -- never happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.90,0:09:00.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-这恐怕是明智的  -我也觉得\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's probably a good call. - I think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.76,0:09:05.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.61,0:09:10.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们开始吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}...let's do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.86,0:09:16.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,多谢联调局对此案的兴趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}Appreciate the FBI taking an interest in this case.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.82,0:09:19.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们这一代不常出这种事\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't really see things like this around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.35,0:09:21.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我可以下班吗  治安官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, you mind if I knock off, Sheriff?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.76,0:09:23.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我猜猜  阿特回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me guess -- Art's back?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.87,0:09:24.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,新婚燕尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Newlyweds.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.28,0:09:28.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,带格里尔探员去找法医报告  然后就能走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can head home after you show Agent Greer the M.E. files.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.11,0:09:28.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢  长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, Sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.91,0:09:29.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.72,0:09:32.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,韦斯·库珀那边查到什么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you have on Wes Cooper?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.54,0:09:34.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我问了他的家人朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}I talked to his friends, family.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.44,0:09:37.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没人能想明白他为什么要这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody can make heads or tails of why he did this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.88,0:09:41.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们有证人在韦斯自杀前听到了他说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have a witness who overheard Wes before he took his own life.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.76,0:09:44.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他说了一些不像他会说的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was saying things that sounded out of character.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.52,0:09:45.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是吗  怎么说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah? How so?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.44,0:09:47.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,韦斯说他的生命毫无意义\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wes said that his life was meaningless,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.20,0:09:49.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没人爱他\N{\fnArial\fs30}nobody loved him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.15,0:09:52.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就好像他所有的负面情绪\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was like every negative thought he had ever had
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.68,0:09:54.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,都爆发了出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}came spilling out.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.46,0:09:55.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,问题是\N{\fnArial\fs30}The thing is...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.01,0:09:58.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我认识韦斯的妻子  我们是一个唱诗班的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew Wes' wife. We sang in choir together.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.37,0:10:00.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她对韦斯的爱至死不渝\N{\fnArial\fs30}She loved Wes till the day she died.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.62,0:10:03.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真不知韦斯为什么要那么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know why he'd say anything like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.79,0:10:05.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还有这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then there's this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.65,0:10:06.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.85,0:10:09.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我见过这样的情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've actually seen something like that before.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.68,0:10:11.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,警官  告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Deputy, tell me,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.61,0:10:14.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,小镇最近出现过什么奇怪现象吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}have you noticed any strange phenomena around town?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.29,0:10:17.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,硫磺味儿  或者断电\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, sulfur smells or power outages?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.44,0:10:19.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或许莫名其妙的雾\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe an unexplained fog?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.36,0:10:20.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.83,0:10:22.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,希望泉永远阳光\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's always sunny in Hope Springs.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.51,0:10:25.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,至少  以前是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}At least, it used to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.72,0:10:44.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你着急吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you in a hurry or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.49,0:10:45.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,赶截稿日期\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm on a bit of a deadline.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.03,0:10:50.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,跟我说个大致  第一印象\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just give me some broad strokes, first impressions.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.67,0:10:51.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,说吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, hit me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.78,0:10:54.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,挺好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.93,0:10:56.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真的很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Real good.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.31,0:10:57.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天呐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.13,0:10:59.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你不喜欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You hate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.28,0:11:02.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么  不是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? No.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.69,0:11:04.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我喜欢  很喜欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love it. Love it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.72,0:11:06.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我上次在编辑脸上看到这副表情\N{\fnArial\fs30}Last time I saw that look on an editor's face,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.88,0:11:08.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我刚交出了《虫子》的书稿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd just handed in "Bugs""
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.13,0:11:10.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,得了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.72,0:11:11.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这里很安全  畅所欲言\N{\fnArial\fs30}Safe place.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.77,0:11:18.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,细节是故事好坏的关键\N{\fnArial\fs30}Details are what make a story great.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.97,0:11:21.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这书缺乏细节\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is lacking in some details.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.03,0:11:24.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,完全没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like all of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.71,0:11:29.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"时间之初  有我"\N{\fnArial\fs30}"In the beginning, there was me."
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.02,0:11:32.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这不是细节吗  多么吸引人啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boom -- detail. And what a grabber.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.32,0:11:34.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我就迷上了  我还是亲历者呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, I'm hooked, and I was there.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.50,0:11:36.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我也迷上了  但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm hooked, too, and yet...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.61,0:11:38.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,需要细节\N{\fnArial\fs30}details.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.00,0:11:41.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,时间之初时  你不是一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You weren't alone in the beginning.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.32,0:11:44.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你妹妹也在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your sister was with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.53,0:11:50.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谁在乎她啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who cares about her?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.37,0:11:56.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,首先  我在乎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me...for starters.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.13,0:12:00.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想你应该知道她...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I assume you're aware that she's...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.54,0:12:02.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,出来活动了\N{\fnArial\fs30}out and about.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.51,0:12:04.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,晒饱了太阳  修养好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tanned, rested, and ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.55,0:12:08.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你就是因为这个才回来了  是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, that's why you're back, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.59,0:12:12.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这不是她的故事\N{\fnArial\fs30}This isn't her story.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.98,0:12:14.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.93,0:12:30.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我以为你要早点回来呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you were coming home early.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.45,0:12:32.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对不起  写文件来着\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry. Paperwork.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.25,0:12:35.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是跟着你从镇上过来的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}That follow you in from town?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.67,0:12:42.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,亲爱的  你先进去  我要报告一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honey, you want to head inside while I call this in?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.52,0:12:44.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就是雾啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just fog.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.46,0:12:46.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道我代表法律吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, you know I'm the law, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.05,0:12:49.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,里面见  警官\N{\fnArial\fs30}See you inside, Deputy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.18,0:12:51.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别忘了你的手铐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't forget your cuffs.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.66,0:12:55.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,调度  这里是3W56\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, dispatch, this is 3-William-56.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.48,0:12:56.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听得到吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got your ears on?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.61,0:12:58.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你不是下班了吗  警官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aren't you done for today, Deputy?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.64,0:12:59.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.51,0:13:00.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听着  我知道听起来可能很怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, I know this might sound odd,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.66,0:13:02.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但有股浓雾往我这边来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but there's a heavy fog headed my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.58,0:13:04.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天气预报里说了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}We expecting any weather like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.32,0:13:07.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有  晚上万里无云的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it's supposed to be clear skies all night.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.90,0:13:47.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那么糟吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\*}That bad?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.33,0:13:51.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,告诉你  里面可有些猛料\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll tell you, there's some great bones in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.88,0:13:53.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我在想缺了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm thinking what's missing --
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.61,0:13:57.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或许别去管细节了  考虑下平衡\N{\fnArial\fs30}maybe less about detail and more about balance.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.58,0:13:58.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.56,0:14:01.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你强调错了重点\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're giving the wrong stuff too much real estate.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.53,0:14:03.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,比如关于做恰克的章节\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like that chapter about being Chuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.45,0:14:05.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.31,0:14:08.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你解释清楚冯内古特行为艺术那套之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Once you've explained the Vonnegut performance art...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.17,0:14:11.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就打住吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}that should be it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.18,0:14:12.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,其余的没人会在乎\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one cares about the rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.56,0:14:14.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我作为恰克干过不少了不起的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did some great stuff as Chuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.31,0:14:17.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我跟你说了  我建了博客\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, I-I told you about my blog.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.94,0:14:19.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, right, yeah. Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.85,0:14:22.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你的猫照博客\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your, uh -- Your cat-pic blog.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.34,0:14:23.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  他们特别可爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, they're super cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.43,0:14:24.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-是啊  -这是一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. - So there's that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.62,0:14:27.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-我还一直在旅行  -嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And, uh, I traveled a lot, you know. - Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.42,0:14:29.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还有  我还约会了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, uh, I dated.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.64,0:14:31.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,交了几个女朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I had some girlfriends.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.01,0:14:33.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,几个男朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Had a few boyfriends.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.49,0:14:36.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我还学会了弹吉他\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I learned how to play guitar.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.92,0:14:43.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.05,0:14:45.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这让你看上去像个\N{\fnArial\fs30}That, you know, makes you seem like
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.85,0:14:49.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很接地气  可爱的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}a really grounded, likable person.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.52,0:14:52.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有什么不对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, what's wrong with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.66,0:14:56.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你既不接地气  也不是人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are neither grounded nor a person!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.40,0:14:58.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-你是说我还算可爱  -不不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So you're saying I'm likable. - No, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.70,0:15:01.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是说  恰克的章节\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am saying the chapter "Chuckle""
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.06,0:15:06.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,花了那么多笔墨  却挤掉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}is devouring pounds of pages at the expense of...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.04,0:15:07.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,更有趣的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}juicier stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.91,0:15:11.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,人们真正想看的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stuff that people might actually want to read.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.82,0:15:12.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,比如呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like what?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.25,0:15:14.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,比如\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, like, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.87,0:15:17.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,大天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like the archangels.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.37,0:15:23.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你就在这里写了两段关于他们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, you have got maybe two paragraphs on them in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.58,0:15:24.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就完了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that's it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.19,0:15:29.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你不觉得该多讲他们两句吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you think they deserve a few extra words?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.25,0:15:32.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,尤其是你的最爱  路西法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Especially your favorite -- Lucifer?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.17,0:15:36.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他不是我的最爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}He wasn't my favorite.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.01,0:15:40.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他帮你打败了阿玛拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}He helped you defeat Amara.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.93,0:15:43.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你把血印托付给了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}You trusted him with the mark.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.08,0:15:46.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-你要他向人类低头时  -他拒绝了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And when you asked him to bow to mankind - He refused.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.92,0:15:48.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他反叛了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He rebelled!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.05,0:15:52.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,并因此破坏了圣诞节\N{\fnArial\fs30}And in doing so, kind of wrecked Christmas.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.34,0:15:53.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那里面都写了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, all that's in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.57,0:15:55.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,除了圣诞节的那部分\N{\fnArial\fs30}Except the -- the bit about Christmas.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.25,0:15:59.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你说  阿玛拉不能写  好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you say that Amara is off limits, fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.75,0:16:02.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但你知道  每个伟大的英雄\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you know every great hero
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.46,0:16:06.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,都是他或她的恶人定义的\N{\fnArial\fs30}is defined by his or her villain.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.30,0:16:07.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,路西法不是恶人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucifer was not a villain.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.02,0:16:10.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他是\N{\fnArial\fs30}He -- He's...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.36,0:16:14.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他从前不是恶人\N{\fnArial\fs30}H-He wasn't a villain.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.77,0:16:17.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.38,0:16:19.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,说实话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Real talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.63,0:16:23.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这里还是能畅所欲言的安全地方吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Th-This is still a safe place, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.95,0:16:25.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,史上最安全的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Safest place ever created.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.86,0:16:28.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.67,0:16:33.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有两种回忆录\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are two types of memoir.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.27,0:16:34.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一种是诚实的\N{\fnArial\fs30}One is honest...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.39,0:16:37.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一种  不怎么诚实\N{\fnArial\fs30}the other, not so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.25,0:16:38.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真话和杜撰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Truth and fairy tale.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.03,0:16:43.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.03,0:16:43.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是想写基斯·理查德斯《人生》那样的大作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, do you want to write "Life" by {\u1}Keith Richards{\u0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.54,0:16:45.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还是想写\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or do you want to write
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.63,0:16:47.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,布莱恩·威尔逊《那多妙》那样的热曲\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Wouldn't It Be Nice" By Brian Wilson?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.12,0:16:49.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想讲真话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to tell the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.39,0:16:51.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那你就得好好忙活了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then you've got some work to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.43,0:16:54.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这本书毫无启示\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are no revelations in this book!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.63,0:16:57.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,考虑到你的身份  这太怪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that's weird, given who you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.48,0:17:00.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有新信息  没有灵魂倾诉\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no new information, no soul-bearing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.84,0:17:02.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为我没有灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's because I don't have a soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.94,0:17:04.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.04,0:17:06.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是  灵魂是你发明的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you invented them.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.47,0:17:10.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你发明了灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}You invented souls!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.94,0:17:13.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,灵魂啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Souls!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.37,0:17:16.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,解释一下这点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Try shining a light on that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.14,0:17:17.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你对此作何感受\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did that make you feel?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.18,0:17:19.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,恶心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nauseous.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.98,0:17:22.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,告诉你  不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what?! No.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.79,0:17:26.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这不是上...帝说的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is not G-O-D talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.88,0:17:28.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是恰克说的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's Chuck talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.08,0:17:31.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我明白  你在地球上时  得完全进入角色\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I get it -- when you were on Earth, you had to go full method.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.90,0:17:34.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你现在该回归自我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it's time for you to get back into character.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.29,0:17:36.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我就是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.46,0:17:37.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.93,0:17:39.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这\N{\fnArial\fs30}This --
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.28,0:17:46.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这堆自我怀疑和无能会淹没世界吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}This pile of self-doubt and nebbishness flooded the Earth?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.83,0:17:50.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,先是毁灭了所多玛  然后又降罪蛾摩拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Followed up Sodom with a blockbuster Gomorrah?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.66,0:17:54.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,造物与惩罚不相上下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Created as much as he punished?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.31,0:17:55.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.59,0:18:00.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我曾经为之工作的那个人  是个狠角色\N{\fnArial\fs30}The guy I worked for -- total badass!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.74,0:18:02.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是的  他有时挺浑的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And yes, he could be a dick.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.34,0:18:04.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, that guy...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.43,0:18:07.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,才有故事可讲\N{\fnArial\fs30}had some stories to tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.73,0:18:11.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也要为很多事负责\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he has a lot to answer for.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.74,0:18:17.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  那\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.78,0:18:20.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我该怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}...what do I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.13,0:18:24.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,拿面镜子照照  让我们看到你是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold up a mirror and show us who you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.58,0:18:26.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,毫无遮掩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Warts and all.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.34,0:18:29.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为一个读者而写\N{\fnArial\fs30}Write for an audience of one --
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.80,0:18:31.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.69,0:18:34.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,像没人在看那样忘我舞蹈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dance like no one else is watching.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.66,0:18:35.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.66,0:18:38.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我无论如何都会帮你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna help you either way.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.24,0:18:41.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但你得选好道路\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you've got to pick a lane.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.41,0:18:46.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,理查德斯还是威尔逊  恰克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Richards or Wilson, Chuck?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.14,0:19:02.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,理查德斯  绝对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Richards -- all the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.13,0:19:04.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(霍华德郡  法医部)
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.01,0:19:20.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉吵醒了你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry I woke you boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.13,0:19:20.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不不  没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, it's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.93,0:19:23.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,跟我们说说情况吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just, uh, why don't you tell us what happened here?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.29,0:19:24.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哈里斯今早没来上班\N{\fnArial\fs30}Harris didn't show up for work this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.96,0:19:26.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们打了电话  呼叫她车台  毫无回应\N{\fnArial\fs30}We called, tried her CB, nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.69,0:19:28.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以我就过来看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I swung by here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.09,0:19:29.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在厨房地板上发现了阿特\N{\fnArial\fs30}I found Art on the kitchen floor,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.75,0:19:33.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哈里斯的猎枪就在他身旁  她...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Harris' shotgun right next to him. She...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.41,0:19:35.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看来哈里斯警官\N{\fnArial\fs30}It looks like Deputy Harris
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.63,0:19:38.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,近距离冲她丈夫脸上开了一枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}shot her husband point-blank in the face,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.60,0:19:39.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,然后离开了现场\N{\fnArial\fs30}then left the scene.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.91,0:19:42.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这几天来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you notice anything off
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.28,0:19:44.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哈里斯警官有什么奇怪表现吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}about Deputy Harris' behavior the last couple days?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.30,0:19:46.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有  完全没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Nothing at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.37,0:19:47.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你最后收到她消息是什么时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}When was the last time anyone heard from her?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.88,0:19:49.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,昨天最后一次呼叫调度\N{\fnArial\fs30}Called in for the last time yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.18,0:19:51.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,提到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Said something about...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.73,0:19:53.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看到浓雾滚来\N{\fnArial\fs30}seeing some fog rolling in.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.45,0:19:56.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不知道她为什么会在乎天气\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know why she cared about the damn weather.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.33,0:19:58.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,能联系一下那位调度员吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you get in contact with your dispatch officer?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.36,0:19:59.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果她再接到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell her to let us know
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.18,0:20:01.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这样的报告要告诉我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}if she gets any more reports like that again.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.74,0:20:03.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-真的吗  -以防万一\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You serious? - Yeah, just to be safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.24,0:20:05.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-你知道哈里斯现在可能在哪吗  -不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And do you have any idea where Harris might be now? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.84,0:20:09.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但我们可以在办公室追踪她的车\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we can track her vehicle from our office.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.92,0:20:21.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, this!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.51,0:20:24.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这才像话\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is what I was talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.26,0:20:27.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"第10章  我为何从不回应祈祷\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Chapter 10 -- Why I Never Answer Prayers,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.13,0:20:29.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而且你该为此庆幸"\N{\fnArial\fs30}and You Should Be Glad I Don't."
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.39,0:20:32.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,第11章  "神助的真相\N{\fnArial\fs30}And chapter 11 -- "The Truth About Divine intervention
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.18,0:20:34.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,以及我尽力回避它的原因"\N{\fnArial\fs30}and Why I Avoid It at All Costs."
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.46,0:20:37.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-好多了吧  -简直太棒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Better, right? - It's gold!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.34,0:20:39.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有点愤怒  有点怨恨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kind of angry with a side of bitter,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.49,0:20:41.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是真实的\N{\fnArial\fs30}but, hey, it's real.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.37,0:20:43.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.07,0:20:47.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不想过分  但既然你写得正顺手\N{\fnArial\fs30}not to overstep my bounds, but since you're on a roll,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.09,0:20:49.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有件事我一直想知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}there's one thing that I've always wondered.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.54,0:20:51.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或许能写出不错的一章来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe it will make a good chapter,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.42,0:20:53.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-甚至一整本书  -说\N{\fnArial\fs30}- maybe even a whole book. - Shoot.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.65,0:20:54.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.32,0:20:57.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,具体点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you be more specific?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.60,0:20:59.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我经常听到这个问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}I kind of get that question a lot
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.10,0:21:01.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,指什么的都有\N{\fnArial\fs30}about pretty much everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.50,0:21:03.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你为什么创造生命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why did you create life?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.95,0:21:09.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得孤单\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was lonely.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.11,0:21:13.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你妹妹的陪伴不够吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your sister wasn't company enough?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.27,0:21:18.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am being.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.73,0:21:21.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她是无\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's nothingness.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.37,0:21:24.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是构不成有趣的两角戏的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not exactly the makings of a fun two-hander, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.86,0:21:25.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.27,0:21:29.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但你不是只创造了一个大天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you didn't stop at one archangel
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.45,0:21:31.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或是一堆天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}or a handful of angels.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.44,0:21:33.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你创造了整个世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}You created worlds.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.52,0:21:34.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是犯蠢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.28,0:21:37.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天真\N{\fnArial\fs30}Naive.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.45,0:21:40.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我以为如果我能让妹妹明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought if I could show my sister
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.54,0:21:43.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这世界不止是我们两个\N{\fnArial\fs30}that there was something more than just us,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.64,0:21:47.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有比我们更好的东西  那她或许会改变\N{\fnArial\fs30}something better than us, then maybe she'd change.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.63,0:21:50.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或许她会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe she'd stop...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.19,0:21:52.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有所改变\N{\fnArial\fs30}being...her.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.90,0:21:54.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}But...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.88,0:21:59.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,每次我建个新世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}every time I'd build a new world...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.66,0:22:01.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她都要毁掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}she'd destroy it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.14,0:22:08.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以你和你的大天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you and your archangels...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.79,0:22:10.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就把她关了起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}locked her away?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.26,0:22:15.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你就开始不受限制地创造了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you got down to unfettered creation.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.71,0:22:19.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,至少是尽力一试了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tried to, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.84,0:22:21.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}But...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.41,0:22:24.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是我创造的  最接近比我和妹妹\N{\fnArial\fs30}this was as close as I got to something as good as or better
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.17,0:22:26.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还好的东西了\N{\fnArial\fs30}than me or my sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.88,0:22:28.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,国家公园体系吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}The National Park system?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.18,0:22:30.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,大自然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nature.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.73,0:22:32.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看看大自然自己都创造了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, look what nature created on its own.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.99,0:22:35.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而且  睿智的大自然知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's more, nature's smart enough to know
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.89,0:22:38.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有些东西是无法修复的\N{\fnArial\fs30}that sometimes, there's no fixing things.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.92,0:22:41.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有时候你只能抹去一切重启\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sometimes you just have to wipe the slate clean.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.99,0:22:43.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,抹去一切重启\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wipe the slate clean.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.88,0:22:45.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.96,0:22:47.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,自然选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}Natural selection.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.34,0:22:49.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好时光啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good times.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.47,0:22:53.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当然  在你这里是淹没地球  但建艘船\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course, in your case, that means flood the Earth,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.19,0:22:55.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,带足东西的意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}but build and stock a boat.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.49,0:22:58.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,换个面  重新开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}Start over fresh on the B-side.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.43,0:23:01.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果阿玛拉抹去重启  就把什么都毁了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If Amara wipes the slate, the slate's destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.10,0:23:03.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一切都会被毁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything is destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.49,0:23:07.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你所有伟大的作品  永远失落\N{\fnArial\fs30}All your great work... lost forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.73,0:23:09.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那我们该去散散步\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should take a stroll, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.41,0:23:13.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,最后一次享受这美景  趁它还没消失\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enjoy it all one last time... before it's all gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.22,0:23:24.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(系统错误  申请未找到)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.14,0:23:26.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我搞不明白  哈里斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't make heads or tails. Harris is...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.12,0:23:29.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,原来是负责我们电脑的\N{\fnArial\fs30}was our computer person.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.24,0:23:30.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我试试吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I give it a shot?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.31,0:23:33.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,治安官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sheriff?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.80,0:23:34.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,马特和艾米刚打来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Matt and Emmy just called in.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.71,0:23:37.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,说看到贾斯帕山附近有浓雾\N{\fnArial\fs30}They said they saw some fog rolling in by Jasper Hills.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.94,0:23:41.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-他们说雾往哪边来了吗  -向西来镇上了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Did they say where it was headed? - West towards town.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.41,0:23:43.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,叫他们回来  进入室内\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, call them back, tell them to get inside,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.00,0:23:44.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,关上门窗  封紧了\N{\fnArial\fs30}shut their windows or doors and seal it up,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.59,0:23:45.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,千万远离浓雾\N{\fnArial\fs30}and stay the hell away from that fog.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.81,0:23:47.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,并通知镇上每个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then get the word out to everybody in town
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.60,0:23:49.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-他们也得这么做  -等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}- they need to do the same damn thing. - Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.16,0:23:51.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你说什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.97,0:23:54.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我和我搭档见识过这种情况  好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}My partner and I have seen this before, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.24,0:23:57.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,韦斯  哈里斯警官是被浓雾里的东西感染了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wes, Deputy Harris were infected by something in this fog.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.53,0:23:58.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道这听上去很疯狂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, I know it sounds crazy --
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.50,0:24:00.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  听上去我们该找疾控中心\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it sounds like we should call the CDC.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.36,0:24:02.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-没时间了  -找到哈里斯警官了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- There's no time for that. - Found Deputy Harris.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.06,0:24:03.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(詹·哈里斯警官)
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.44,0:24:06.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她在主街  往这边来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's on Main Street, heading right this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.19,0:24:07.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们去对付哈里斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, we'll handle Harris.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.45,0:24:08.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一定把话传出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just please, get the word out,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.65,0:24:10.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,叫大家都待在室内\N{\fnArial\fs30}tell everybody they need to stay inside,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.29,0:24:12.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,封好门窗\N{\fnArial\fs30}seal up their windows, their doors -- everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.53,0:24:13.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.72,0:24:27.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,把他们赶走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, get them out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.55,0:24:31.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,联调局  格里尔探员  请你们马上进入室内\N{\fnArial\fs30}Agent Greer, FBI. I need you to get inside immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.11,0:24:31.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.44,0:24:36.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想自杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}I tried to kill myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.11,0:24:38.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但她不让\N{\fnArial\fs30}But she won't let me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.73,0:24:44.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她有话要我转达给你  迪恩·温彻斯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}She has a message -- for you, Dean Winchester.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.93,0:24:46.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,阿玛拉  她在这儿吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amara? Is she here?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.95,0:24:47.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.61,0:24:50.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但自从我吸入了那浓雾\N{\fnArial\fs30}But her words have been echoing in my head
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.30,0:24:53.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她的声音就一直在我脑袋里回荡\N{\fnArial\fs30}every since I took a breath of that fog.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.09,0:24:54.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是她叫你杀你丈夫的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did she tell you to kill your husband?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.42,0:24:58.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我看着自己动手的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I watched myself do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.21,0:25:01.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好的  听我说  这是感染\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, listen to me, this is an infection.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.28,0:25:02.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,放下枪  让我们帮你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put the gun down. Let us help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.39,0:25:04.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不是感染\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not an infection.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.48,0:25:07.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她说这是镜子\N{\fnArial\fs30}She says it's a mirror.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.31,0:25:10.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她要让我们看到真相\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's showing us all the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.60,0:25:12.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,黑暗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.54,0:25:14.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,光明只是谎言\N{\fnArial\fs30}The light was just a lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.36,0:25:29.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这一切很快就会结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It will all be over soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.61,0:25:32.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他不会救他们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not gonna save them.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.48,0:25:34.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一切都会消逝\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all going away...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.11,0:25:37.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,彻底毁灭\N{\fnArial\fs30}forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.28,0:25:41.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但你不会  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}But not you, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.48,0:25:48.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.74,0:25:50.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.87,0:26:15.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,大自然  是神圣的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\*}Nature? Divine.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.66,0:26:17.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,人性  是恶毒的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Human nature -- toxic.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.28,0:26:21.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们确实喜欢搞破坏\N{\fnArial\fs30}They do like blowing stuff up.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.57,0:26:22.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.51,0:26:24.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,最糟的是  他们还打着我的名号\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the worst part -- they do it in my name.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.90,0:26:25.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,然后又来找我哭诉\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then they come crying to me,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.96,0:26:28.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,求我原谅  让我善后\N{\fnArial\fs30}asking me to forgive, to fix things.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.04,0:26:30.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,从不承担一点责任\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never taking any responsibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.37,0:26:32.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那你的责任呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about your responsibility?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.23,0:26:35.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我承担责任了啊  我离开了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I took responsibility... by leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.34,0:26:38.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,辅助轮早晚是得拿掉的嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}At a certain point, training wheels got to come off.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.57,0:26:40.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没人喜欢步步紧盯的父母\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one likes a helicopter parent.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.16,0:26:43.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,阿玛拉呢  她是你妹妹\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about Amara? She's your sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.30,0:26:45.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我也为她承担了责任\N{\fnArial\fs30}I took responsibility for her, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.49,0:26:48.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,把她锁了起来  而且很不容易呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Locked her away -- barely, I might add.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.20,0:26:50.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不过是谁放她出来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And who let her out?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.30,0:26:52.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,温家兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam and Dean Winchester,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.74,0:26:54.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可他们在试图弥补\N{\fnArial\fs30}but they're trying to fix that.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.22,0:26:55.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道我喜欢他俩\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know I love those guys,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.18,0:26:57.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但要是迪恩还是恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}but the world would still be spinning
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.50,0:26:59.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,世界本会运转如常\N{\fnArial\fs30}with Demon Dean in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.56,0:27:01.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可萨姆就是接受不了  对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}But Sam couldn't have that, though, could he?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.86,0:27:03.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以阿玛拉出来了怎么能怪我\N{\fnArial\fs30}And so how is Amara being out on me?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.65,0:27:04.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不怪你\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.41,0:27:07.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可你以前帮过温家兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you helped the Winchesters before.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.26,0:27:09.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,帮他们  我是救了他们的小命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Helped them?! I've saved them!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.37,0:27:12.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我都数不清重塑了卡西迪奥多少次了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've rebuilt Castiel more times than I can remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.64,0:27:13.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瞧瞧我什么下场\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look where that got me.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.48,0:27:15.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那你就要让阿玛拉赢吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you're just gonna let Amara win?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.83,0:27:17.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,轮到她大放异彩了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's her time to shine.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.90,0:27:21.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那我们为啥还要写你那傻逼回忆录\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then why the hell are we working on your stupid memoir?!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.00,0:27:24.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得那很傻逼吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think it's stupid?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.38,0:27:27.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  我觉得要写一本\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I think it's stupid to write a book
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.36,0:27:29.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,根本没人能读到的书才傻逼\N{\fnArial\fs30}nobody is gonna be around to read!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.36,0:27:32.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你说只为一位读者而写  我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You told me to write for an audience of one -- me.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.65,0:27:36.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得总算说到点子上了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I think we're finally getting somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.05,0:27:39.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她一回来你就开始写了  是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You started writing the second she came back, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.24,0:27:42.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,难怪你要赶截稿日期呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}No wonder you're on a deadline!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.20,0:27:45.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在我知道你为什么要伪装在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now I understand why you're masquerading
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.57,0:27:47.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那具可悲的皮囊里了\N{\fnArial\fs30}in that sad little meat suit!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.39,0:27:51.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,跟你创造这怀旧酒吧的理由一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}For the same reason you created this nostalgic bar
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.69,0:27:55.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好写你的巨著  你是在躲藏\N{\fnArial\fs30}to write your masterpiece in -- you're hiding!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.82,0:27:56.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.10,0:27:59.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,首先  这份天赐\N{\fnArial\fs30}First of all, this gift...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.86,0:28:01.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,超级可爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}is super cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.48,0:28:03.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,其次  我没躲着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Secondly, I'm not hiding.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.04,0:28:06.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我只是喜欢这里的气氛\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just like the ambiance in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.91,0:28:08.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.55,0:28:10.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是史上最安全的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}the safest place ever created.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.84,0:28:12.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是你自己创造的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Created by you...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.59,0:28:15.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,保护你不受阿玛拉的伤害\N{\fnArial\fs30}to keep you safe from Amara!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.32,0:28:16.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她在这里没法碰你  对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}She can't touch you in here, can she?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.88,0:28:18.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你不高兴  我理解\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're upset. I-I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.97,0:28:21.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你说出来挺好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it's good to let it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.20,0:28:24.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但咱们还是先专注写完我的书吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, uh, let's focus on, uh, fi, shing my book.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.25,0:28:29.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,知道吗  我之前是个挺糟的上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I was a crappy, terrible god.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.15,0:28:35.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的工作基本就是随便改写一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}My work was pretty much a lame, half-assed rewrite
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.38,0:28:37.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你的壮举\N{\fnArial\fs30}of your greatest hits.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.38,0:28:41.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但起码我从来不是个懦夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}But at least I was never a coward.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.03,0:29:10.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这就对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.64,0:29:15.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这才是我认识喜欢的那家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the guy I know, the guy I love.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.62,0:29:18.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我还记得第一次见到你时\N{\fnArial\fs30}I remember the first time I saw you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.73,0:29:21.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所有天使都吓坏了  可我没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}All the angels were terrified, but I wasn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.25,0:29:24.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你散发的光的感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}The feeling of your light was...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.00,0:29:26.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,难以名状\N{\fnArial\fs30}was just beyond measure.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.33,0:29:30.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,之后的事更是超乎想象\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then the unthinkable.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.15,0:29:36.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你选了我帮你写碑文\N{\fnArial\fs30}You picked me to help you with your tablets.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.53,0:29:39.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你只是我进屋时\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were just the closest angel to the door
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.17,0:29:40.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,离门口最近的天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}when I walked into the room.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.68,0:29:45.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你没什么特别的  梅塔特隆\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's nothing special about you, Metatron.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.43,0:29:47.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当时没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not then...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.79,0:29:49.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在也没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}not now.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.47,0:29:53.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.27,0:29:55.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我被人冠以过很多名头\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been called many things --
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.15,0:30:00.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,缺席的父亲  狂怒的怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}absentee father, wrathful monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.25,0:30:03.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但懦夫...\N{\fnArial\fs30}But coward...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.53,0:30:07.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不是在逃避\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am not hiding.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.26,0:30:11.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我只是受够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am just done
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.00,0:30:15.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,目睹我的实验的失败\N{\fnArial\fs30}watching my experiments' failures.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.34,0:30:19.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是说你自己的失败吧  恰克\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean your failures, Chuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.62,0:30:27.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你想看吗  请随意\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to watch? Be my guest.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.36,0:30:29.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,据报此前天空万里无云\N{\fnArial\fs30}Reports are that there wasn't a cloud in the sky,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.68,0:30:31.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但总所周知  现在出现了一股浓雾\N{\fnArial\fs30}but as we know, a dense fog did roll in.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.89,0:30:33.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而且许多市民都感受到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And many citizens also are feeling
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.27,0:30:36.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这股雾给他们带来的某种影响\N{\fnArial\fs30}some sort of impact from this fog
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.14,0:30:38.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这让我们相信雾中有...\N{\fnArial\fs30}leads us to believe that there is some sort of...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.31,0:30:40.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要我说的话  这些都是重播\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you ask me, they're all reruns.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.48,0:30:41.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,应接不暇\N{\fnArial\fs30}...have been overwhelmed...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.68,0:30:44.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,国民警卫队已经介入\N{\fnArial\fs30}as the National Guard has been brought in.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.60,0:30:47.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快离开这里  快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, you got to go. Get!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.55,0:30:49.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,小甜心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, sweetheart.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.36,0:30:50.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们得带你离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, we're gonna get you out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.73,0:30:52.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,带你去安全的地方  好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna get you safe, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.55,0:30:54.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别担心  好吗  伸手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you worry, okay? Give me your hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.91,0:30:56.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢配合\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.92,0:30:58.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了  好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.27,0:30:59.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-谢谢你  -到底发生什么事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Thank you. - What the hell's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.77,0:31:00.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,请尽快离开这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just get out of here, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.87,0:31:02.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-这雾是怎么回事  -快进屋去\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's this fog doing? - Just get inside now!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.59,0:31:03.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快  快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.47,0:31:07.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快来  萨姆  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Sam, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.90,0:31:09.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别管他们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let them go!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.20,0:31:25.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,艾尔哈特探员  无线电失效了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Agent Ehart? Radio's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.93,0:31:28.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有胶带吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have any duct tape?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.34,0:31:39.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam? Sam?!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.56,0:32:06.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(无信号)
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.62,0:32:08.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(无信号)
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.68,0:32:11.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,治安官  我们试试看能不能把无线电修好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sheriff, let's see if we can't fix that radio of yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.61,0:32:30.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.47,0:32:41.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你听到了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You hear that?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.54,0:33:07.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.98,0:33:32.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.05,0:33:38.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,伙计们  我们得待在一起  明白吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\*}Folks, we need to stay together, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.59,0:33:40.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.36,0:33:42.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  不  别过来  不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, get back! Don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.46,0:33:44.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天呐  他被感染了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My God, he's infected.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.09,0:33:49.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所有人  都到里面去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody, get inside!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.99,0:33:52.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,都来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.81,0:33:54.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快  快进去  快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Let's move. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.62,0:34:00.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快来  我们走  快进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on! Let's go! Get in here!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.32,0:34:01.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  我不会离开我弟弟的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I'm not leaving my brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.25,0:34:10.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你真是个很棒的编辑  梅塔特隆\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, you really are a terrific editor, Metatron.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.28,0:34:15.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是个糟糕的作家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I was a terrible writer.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.20,0:34:17.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,烂透了的上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}A worse God.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.52,0:34:20.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,幸好我还是有所长的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's good I got something going for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.96,0:34:21.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,知道吗  我必须承认\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, you know, I have to say,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.89,0:34:24.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我完全没料到你会黑化\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't see the whole evil-turn thing coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.61,0:34:27.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你为什么要试图成为我啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why did you try to be me?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.92,0:34:32.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那只是可悲地求关注而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was just a sad, pathetic cry for attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.07,0:34:34.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你想吸引谁的注意啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whose attention were you trying to get?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.36,0:34:36.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.25,0:34:39.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是光\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are light...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.48,0:34:41.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是美\N{\fnArial\fs30}and beauty.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.32,0:34:43.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是创造\N{\fnArial\fs30}Creation.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.13,0:34:45.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是怒火\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wrath.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.47,0:34:48.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是毁灭也是救赎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damnation and salvation.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.46,0:34:51.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不在乎自己是否只是\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I don't care if I was just
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.05,0:34:56.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,离门最近的那个天使而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}the angel nearest the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.41,0:34:59.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你选择了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You picked me.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.25,0:35:05.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你的光辉照耀在了我身上  我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your light shined on me -- me!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.24,0:35:09.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还有你的温暖\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, and the warmth.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.45,0:35:12.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但之后你离开了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}But then you left me.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.25,0:35:15.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你离开了我们所有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You left all of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.82,0:35:21.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,向你祈祷的不止是地球上的那帮呆子\N{\fnArial\fs30}It wasn't just the saps on Earth who were praying to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.91,0:35:23.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天使也会祈祷\N{\fnArial\fs30}The angels prayed, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.94,0:35:25.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我也祈祷  每天都祈祷\N{\fnArial\fs30}And so did I -- every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.55,0:35:27.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.34,0:35:30.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你想写出有史以来最畅销的自传\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to write the best-selling autobiography of all time,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.87,0:35:32.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你就得给我个解释\N{\fnArial\fs30}you explain to me --
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.94,0:35:35.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,告诉我你为何抛弃了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}tell me why you abandoned me.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.86,0:35:37.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,抛弃了我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Us.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.63,0:35:39.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为你让我失望了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because you disappointed me.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.27,0:35:41.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们所有人都让我失望了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You all disappointed me.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.64,0:35:42.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.56,0:35:44.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道我令你失望\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know I'm a disappointment,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.87,0:35:47.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但你关于人的看法是错的\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you're wrong about humanity.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.13,0:35:49.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,人是你最伟大的造物\N{\fnArial\fs30}They are your greatest creation
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.16,0:35:51.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为他们比你强\N{\fnArial\fs30}because they're better than you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.66,0:35:56.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没错  人类软弱  欺骗  偷盗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, sure, they're weak and they cheat and steal
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.02,0:35:59.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,破坏  辜负希望\N{\fnArial\fs30}and...destroy and disappoint.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.69,0:36:04.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可他们也会给予  创造\N{\fnArial\fs30}But they also give and create
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.57,0:36:07.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,懂得享乐  懂得去爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}and they sing and dance and love.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.57,0:36:12.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,最重要的是  他们永不言弃\N{\fnArial\fs30}And above all, they never give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.33,0:36:16.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而你恰恰相反\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.47,0:36:47.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.74,0:36:50.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, listen to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.96,0:36:52.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-萨姆  -我们做不到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sam! - We're not gonna make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.18,0:36:53.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不不  不能放弃\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no. There's no quitting here.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.61,0:36:56.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-我们做不到的  -萨姆  听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We're never gonna make it. - Sam, listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.43,0:36:57.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是因为雾的关系才会这么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not you talking, it's the fog.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.72,0:37:00.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你本打算选阿玛拉  而不是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were gonna choose Amara over me.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.11,0:37:01.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不是其他的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Over everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.78,0:37:03.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-萨姆  别  -对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sam, no! - Look, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.22,0:37:04.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不是真心的  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't mean that, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.49,0:37:06.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我撑不住的  你快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't fight this. You got to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.44,0:37:08.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在你也被感染之前快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got to get out before you're infected.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.28,0:37:09.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,趁我还没有伤害你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go before I hurt you!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.30,0:37:11.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我永远不会抛下你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I'm not leaving you -- ever!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.78,0:37:14.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.88,0:37:35.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,停下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop this!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.98,0:37:37.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听见没有  混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}You hear me, you dick?!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.54,0:37:48.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别  别  别\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no, no, no, no, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.67,0:37:50.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, hey, look at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.24,0:37:51.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看着我  有我在呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at me. I'm right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.60,0:37:52.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有我在呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.67,0:37:54.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没事了  不会有事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, it's okay. It's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.81,0:37:55.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我在呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.47,0:37:57.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我在呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.03,0:38:31.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我之前撒了谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\*}You know, I lied before.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.52,0:38:34.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我其实没亲自学会弹吉他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't really learn to play guitar.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.15,0:38:38.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而是直接给了自己那能力\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just kind of... gave myself the ability.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.61,0:38:41.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"学"法语时也是这么干的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did the same when I "learned" French.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.52,0:38:45.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,说实话的感觉真轻松\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man, this whole honesty thing -- it's really freeing.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.69,0:38:48.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.17,0:38:50.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看看新出炉的故事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take a look at the new pages.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.88,0:38:52.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你想看的  对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know you want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.87,0:38:55.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,算了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I'll pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.35,0:38:59.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你会喜欢的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you're really gonna like them.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.88,0:39:01.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你说得对  有点高了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're right. It -- It's a little high.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.89,0:39:04.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.95,0:39:06.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,随你便吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Suit yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.04,0:39:18.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,*若我有双*\N{\fnArial\fs30}*If I had wings*
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.44,0:39:22.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,*诺亚之鸽的翅膀*\N{\fnArial\fs30}*Like Noah's dove*
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.72,0:39:25.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,*我会飞过河流*\N{\fnArial\fs30}*I'd fly up the river*
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.21,0:39:29.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,*来到爱人身旁*\N{\fnArial\fs30}*To the one I love*
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.54,0:39:33.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,*望你一切安好*\N{\fnArial\fs30}*Fare thee well*
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.54,0:39:35.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,*亲爱的*\N{\fnArial\fs30}*Oh, honey*
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.63,0:39:42.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,*望你一切安好*\N{\fnArial\fs30}*Fare thee well*
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.35,0:39:49.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,*有位故人*\N{\fnArial\fs30}*I knew a man*
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.67,0:39:53.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,*个子高高*\N{\fnArial\fs30}*Who was long and tall*
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.73,0:39:56.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,*飞奔的速度*\N{\fnArial\fs30}*He moved his body*
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.09,0:40:00.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,*像门加农炮*\N{\fnArial\fs30}*Like a cannonball*
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.16,0:40:04.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,*望你一切安好*\N{\fnArial\fs30}*Oh, fare thee well*
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.28,0:40:06.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,*亲爱的*\N{\fnArial\fs30}*Oh, honey*
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.34,0:40:13.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,*望你一切安好*\N{\fnArial\fs30}*Fare thee well*
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.99,0:40:20.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,*那一晚*\N{\fnArial\fs30}*Remember one night*
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.36,0:40:23.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,*烟雨蒙蒙*\N{\fnArial\fs30}*In the drizzling rain*
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.21,0:40:26.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,*我的心房*\N{\fnArial\fs30}*And around my heart*
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.87,0:40:30.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,*一阵剧痛*\N{\fnArial\fs30}*I felt an aching pain*
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.64,0:40:34.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,*望你一切安好*\N{\fnArial\fs30}*Fare thee well*
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.50,0:40:36.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,*亲爱的*\N{\fnArial\fs30}*Oh, honey*
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.61,0:40:43.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,*望你一切安好*\N{\fnArial\fs30}*Fare thee well, mm-mm*
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.94,0:40:50.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,*不久之后*\N{\fnArial\fs30}*One of these days*
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.44,0:40:53.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,*那一天终将到来*\N{\fnArial\fs30}*It won't be long*
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.32,0:40:57.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,*你会呼唤我的名字*\N{\fnArial\fs30}*You'll call my name*
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.87,0:41:00.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,*我却已不在*\N{\fnArial\fs30}*And I'll be gone*
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.69,0:41:04.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,*望你一切安好*\N{\fnArial\fs30}*Fare thee well*
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.89,0:41:07.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,*亲爱的*\N{\fnArial\fs30}*Oh, honey*
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.95,0:41:13.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,*望你一切安好*\N{\fnArial\fs30}*Fare thee well*
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.29,0:41:23.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,*望你一切安好*\N{\fnArial\fs30}*Fare thee well*
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.04,0:41:36.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-还好吗  -谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You okay? - Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.65,0:41:38.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.54,0:41:54.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们大概该谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should probably talk.

